From: W1700KNPU development <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [CANDIDATE] wifi: mt7996: prepare bounded RX header views

Pull only the required RXD and data header prefix before caching
parser pointers. Retain non-linear packet bodies, snapshot RXV
metadata across packet edits, and bound the common type dispatch.

Unpromoted; firmware-event payload semantics and physical NPU
publication/lifetime remain separate integration contracts.

---
--- a/mt7996/mac.c
+++ b/mt7996/mac.c
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
  */
 
